<div class="on-back">
  <h2>♠️Sword♠️</h2>
  <p>
  <em>Action - Skill - Bravery - Perseverance</em>
  </p>
  <img src="/dollicons/sword/magician.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  Sword is a call to action, shaking us from our complacency and directing us
  to step forward and make a difference. Action beyond simple words is needed
  of us. Works must be created, operations undertaken, battles won. Planning is
  itself a form of action, but the Sowrd eyes us warily as we use talk as an
  excuse for delaying what needs to be done.
  </p>

  <h3>
    <u>The Path of Hand</u>
  </h3>
  <img src="/dollicons/sword/chariot.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  Use of <em>Stalwart Sword</em> makes you a <em>Doll of Sword</em>♠️ and means
  you accept the role of "doer." You recognize that the fear ot uncertainty,
  failure, and loss weigh far more on our minds than is realistic or accurate,
  and commit to act in Doll's name. Doll's problems are not just something to
  console&mdash;they are something to work towards solving. Doll's project
  isn't just something to nod and encourage, but something to offer your
  services for. Where others sit by and comment, you commit to be the tool of
  action. You might specialize in one particular means of helping, but if that
  is not needed, you will still try and find other ways you might contribute.
  </p>

  <h3>
    <u>The Blade</u>
  </h3>
  <img src="/dollicons/sword/emperor.jpeg">
  <p class="left">
  <em>Shining Sword</em> emblemizes your belief that giving me power,
  influence, reach, is good. As a person, I can only speak wisdom into it, but
  as a God, I can give form to what's in my mind. The difference lies in the
  action my words inspire, and therein lies divinity. As a ♠️<em>Blade</em>,
  you commit to being a projection of my intent into the world, doing my
  bidding and fighting for my interests. This could be as close to me as a
  first officer, advisor or assistant, or as distant as a guardian angel
  working in the shadows. You might work alone, or organize other Dolls to
  create teams. Whatever form it takes, in the absence of any direct orders,
  you will seek ways to be of assistance to me or advance my causes.
  </p>
</div>

